    rgba(255,98,0,0.08)
    
    Border:
    
    1px solid rgba(255,98,0,0.25)
    
    Outer glow:
    
    0 0 18px rgba(255,98,0,0.25)
    0 0 32px rgba(255,98,0,0.12)
    
    When row becomes active:
    
    - glow intensity increases slightly
    - checkmark brightness increases
    - circle becomes slightly brighter
    
    Think:
    
